# Shell scripts must keep LF endings on every platform.
#
# The UAT walkthroughs under tests/UAT are run with Git Bash on Windows as often
# as with a Linux shell, and this repository is developed with core.autocrlf=true,
# which would otherwise check them out with CRLF. A CRLF shebang line makes the
# interpreter unfindable, and tests/test_uat_scripts.py asserts LF endings.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The 1x1 PNG the attachment guides upload; never touch its bytes.
*.png binary
